orbit-tape (0.11.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Indicators: Key Levels (daily/weekly/monthly/quarterly/yearly opens,
    previous ranges and mids, Monday range, sessions), Bull Market Support
    Band and SMA x4 in indicators/market/.
  * Accent colors and indicator color inputs are squares: click one for a
    color picker or type any hex. Hand-set accents stay when the COSMIC
    palette changes.
  * Indicators with many plots keep working on long histories, and an
    unavailable overlay shows why in the legend.
  * orbit-tape scan: headless Roman Setup scan of perps (OKX by default)
    with a desktop notification and an optional systemd user timer.
  * Live reload of user indicator files, fired-alert history, configurable
    indicator catalog address, Wayland only.

